{
	"intro": [
		"This collection started with <code>const</code>. Everyone who writes code knows this keyword, and I thought I did too. Yet every time I wanted to use it, its various uses slipped right out of my head, and I'd end up asking AI or Googling it to catch up. So I wrote one detailed note about it, then another, and the pile kept growing. I'd rather not burn AI tokens relearning something I've seen a thousand times. So far, worth it.",
		"It covers a lot of ground now, and I'm thinking about adding things beyond my profession, like how to play support in Overwatch (lol). I'm putting this online for myself, but also for anyone who's had the same &quot;wait, I knew this&quot; moment.",
		"Hope you enjoy it."
	],
